  "description": "* Build Your Dream Farm *\nHarvest Cafe is a cosy open-world farming and restaurant adventure set on a beautiful island full of charm, opportunities and secrets to uncover. Grow a wide range of crops, gather useful materials and expand your land as you build the farm you’ve always dreamed of.\n\n* Cook and Serve Delicious Meals *\nTurn your harvest into delicious meals and serve them in your very own restaurant in the village centre. Unlock new recipes, expand your menu and keep customers coming back for more as your café grows into one of the island’s favourite destinations.\n\n* Explore and Restore the Island *\nThere’s more to the island than farming and cooking. Explore abandoned harbours, buildings and shops, restore forgotten places and help bring life back to the island. As you repair and improve the world around you, more tourists begin to arrive.\n\n* Grow Your Business *\nAs your business grows, so do your opportunities. Upgrade your restaurant, hire staff such as cooks and waiters and serve more customers with greater efficiency. From humble beginnings to a bustling island hotspot, every step of your journey brings new rewards.",
